, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 3 | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 PCP iVA p.111\n#: 31 | Final Corrected Claim: *Positively reinforcing continued use of JARDIANCE may significantly reduce the risk of CV death or HHF.1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Efficacy / Clinical benefit | End Audience: HCP/Internal"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1ad40cca-1793-460c-b468-b7a8c1e804c9", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 18, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "57915d652498f4f28854d141c04325fb6af9a5d2f27262c6e635636b49297a71", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "1ad40cca-1793-460c-b468-b7a8c1e804c9", "text": "plete | Indication: Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Efficacy / Clinical benefit | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.45; 2026 Card iVA p.88 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 1 | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.45; 2026 Card iVA p.88\n#: 32 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE protects your patients by reducing the risk of CV death or HHF†1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Efficacy / Clinical benefit | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.69 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is req