have recently been shown to improve clinical outcomes in adult patients with HFrEF. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.127 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.127\n#: 100 | Final Corrected Claim: *EMPEROR-Preserved included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%).1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Inte"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:636eb3c1-5fe4-4bbc-86a8-85572c14f038", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 63, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "f37b5f318991987084962af10892b3b11c6e4b06b0abf36bb2d41c58a5505e24", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "636eb3c1-5fe4-4bbc-86a8-85572c14f038", "text": "ction (LVEF >40%).1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Study/programme: EMPEROR-Preserved | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.97; 2026 Card iVA p.34; 2026 Card iVA p.57; 2026 Card iVA p.70; 2026 Card iVA p.73; 2026 Card iVA p.76; 2026 Card iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.141; 2026 Card iVA p.169; 2026 Card iVA p.172; 2026 PCP iVA p.117 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 1 | Reference: EMPEROR-Preserved | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.97; 2026 Card iVA p.34; 2026 Card iVA p.57; 2026 Card iVA p.70; 2026 Card iVA p.73; 2026 Card iVA p.76; 2026 Card iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.141; 2026 Card iVA p.169; 2026 Card iVA p.172; 2026 PCP iVA p.117\n#: 101 | Final Corrected Claim: *EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%).1 | Status: Confirmed"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:ca5162c1-3944-4d75-bc91-be9b60a3ee22", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 64, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "410a8007684c4eaf2cb8b50393740742be4ac2734963e54a029aa2927962c650", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "ca5162c1-3944-4d75-bc91-be9b60a3ee22", "text": ": *EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%).1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Study/programme: EMPEROR-Reduced | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.97; 2026 Card iVA p.12; 2026 Card iVA p.28; 2026 Card iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.34; 2026 Card iVA p.42; 2026 Card iVA p.76; 2026 Card iVA p.141; 2026 Card iVA p.166; 2026 Card iVA p.172; 2026 PCP iVA p.117 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 1 | Reference: EMPEROR-Reduced | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.97; 2026 Card iVA p.12; 2026 Card iVA p.28; 2026 Card iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.34; 2026 Card iVA p.42; 2026 Card iVA p.76; 2026 Card iVA p.141; 2026 Card iVA p.166; 2026 Card iVA p.172; 2026 PCP iVA p.117\n#: 102 | Final Corrected Claim: *EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:ed36e30b-3df0-4032-94c5-6302bcce2ad8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 65, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "c4ba17461ce244f1e2c18a5294501e9fad60182d535be1d8e68fd6b97e3b1213", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "ed36e30b-3df0-4032-94c5-6302bcce2ad8", "text": "Card iVA p.141; 2026 Card iVA p.166; 2026 Card iVA p.172; 2026 PCP iVA p.117\n#: 102 | Final Corrected Claim: *EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%). | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.55 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 1 | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 PCP iVA p.55\n#: 103 | Final Corrected Claim: Despite being a guideline-recommended treatment across LVEF, \nSGLT2is remain underutilised to treat HF. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.60 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnote"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:36ee832c-b6b7-4337-b65a-3de509037736", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 66, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "4f33119383a6f67c120415a98379a0be3eb166634cc91112e4c50023547db829", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "36ee832c-b6b7-4337-b65a-3de509037736", "text": "p.60 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.60\n#: 104 | Final Corrected Claim: In the EMPEROR-Reduced trial, a randomised, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled study of 3730 patients with HFrEF, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=1863) were evaluated vs placebo (n=1867). Patients were adults with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%). The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced trial was a composite of CV death or hospitalisation for HF, analysed as time to the first event. Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 25% RRR in this endpoint \n(HR=0.75; 95% CI: 0.65, 0.86; p<0.001). | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29; 2026 PCP iVA p.111"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:8a535cb1-ad52-42f3-b81b-9302ace79430", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 67, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "19f3abe69706e20bcba4567b045c562fa1cbb371ca1301a6e3e3fa7093de36fc", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "8a535cb1-ad52-42f3-b81b-9302ace79430", "text": "Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29; 2026 PCP iVA p.111 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29; 2026 PCP iVA p.111\n#: 105 | Final Corrected Claim: In the EMPEROR-Preserved trial, a randomised, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled study of 5988 patients with HFpEF, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=2997) were evaluated vs placebo (n=2991). Patients were adults with chronic heart failure (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%). The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR-Preserved trial was a composite of CV death or HHF, analysed as time to the first event. Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 21% RRR in this endpoint \n(HR=0.79; 95% CI: 0.69, 0.90; p<0.001). | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantit"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5fa48b15-6f73-4d8b-adf0-b76fabf02d34", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 68, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "24f9897b26a230d5160b8cb34c253fc021424ed06e2ee32944a374853c0de180", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "5fa48b15-6f73-4d8b-adf0-b76fabf02d34", "text": "Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.70; 2026 Card iVA p.73; 2026 Card iVA p.104 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.70; 2026 Card iVA p.73; 2026 Card iVA p.104\n#: 106 | Final Corrected Claim: Patients were adults with chronic heart failure (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%). | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 C"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:608c553b-8fb2-46e3-8f28-796b47e95e2f", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 69, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "3e810ab5f4261d7c1d646a14ac0223d9f7bd6eb62b6ed57d4e1b4ec0d91122dd", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "608c553b-8fb2-46e3-8f28-796b47e95e2f", "text": "ormation: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.28; 2026 Card iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.91; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.28; 2026 Card iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104\n#: 107 | Final Corrected Claim: In addition to the RRR of all HHF, including first and recurrent events, the risk of total hospitalisations for any reason was also significantly reduced (HR=0.85; 95% CI: 0.75, 0.95).1 \n\nII Standard of care: All patients received appropriate treatments for heart failure, including diuretics, inhibitors of the renin-angiotensin system and neprilysin, beta blockers, mineralocorticoid receptor antagonists and, when indicated, cardiac devices.1 | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audi"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:71601259-0d1c-4072-8fab-89196ab4d7e3", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 70, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "0f702b9c08877c13f03c4c7d541143cc2a1c2e9007134edc9dea03f574f5d4cb", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "71601259-0d1c-4072-8fab-89196ab4d7e3", "text": "sts and, when indicated, cardiac devices.1 | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 95%; HR=0.85; 95% CI: 0 | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.31 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.31\n#: 108 | Final Corrected Claim: †Adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%).2 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 40% | Specialty context: Cardiology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.55 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 2 | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 PCP iVA p.55\n#: 109 | Final Corrected Claim: Key inclusion criteria in"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:64f5312f-2b81-407b-b7a5-41391067709b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 71, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "2bfe4cf80ba1d941b7280433e7b6b9162cbb37572c48084e5539627769ec606e", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "64f5312f-2b81-407b-b7a5-41391067709b", "text": "gulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 2 | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 PCP iVA p.55\n#: 109 | Final Corrected Claim: Key inclusion criteria included a chronic HF (NYHA class II-IV) diagnosis, an elevated NT-proBNP level, and structural heart changes or documented hospitalisation for HF within 12 months. Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of >300 pg/mL or, for patients with atrial fibrillation at baseline, a level of >900 pg/mL.2 | Status: Corrected | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157; 2026 PCP iVA p.105 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 12 | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157; 2026 PCP iVA p.105\n#: 110 | Final Corrected Claim: ‡Standard of care: All patients received appropriate treatments for heart failure, including diuretics, inhibitors of the renin-angiotens"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:fa9f716c-4335-4b5e-a0c5-449965e0589b", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 72, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "7a786902c0d467f6d5f631a03c14a566e108f8c61ac5c4ee083e99fab72160cf", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "fa9f716c-4335-4b5e-a0c5-449965e0589b", "text": "ected Claim: ‡Standard of care: All patients received appropriate treatments for heart failure, including diuretics, inhibitors of the renin-angiotensin system and neprilysin, beta blockers, | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Heart failure | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.