ialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.24 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 3 | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.24 | Note: Observation text appears mismatched/unrelated to this row; claim itself is complete and matches duplicate entry (p.42) marked complete and substantiated\n#: 113 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE is 1A recommended for first-"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:576eb325-b0ff-47d7-9572-8e289d22e19c", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 74, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "f861c5410f95027da8329b9842fff9fc6dd383185b2019edb73a9200cfd8fa13", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "576eb325-b0ff-47d7-9572-8e289d22e19c", "text": "s complete and matches duplicate entry (p.42) marked complete and substantiated\n#: 113 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE is 1A recommended for first-line treatment of CKD, with or without T2D9 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.42 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 9 | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.42\n#: 114 | Final Corrected Claim: In addition to reducing the risk of CV death when added to the standard of care, JARDIANCE lowered HbA1c,  weight and blood pressure. JARDIANCE is not indicated for weight loss or reduction of blood pressure. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Guideline / Standard of care | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:ea8c5f15-a843-4a5f-9164-b7ee427e2a15", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 75, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "b7be3fa00411ffa255104a2d0e8489334a380e7b56c0376b8c171f8b58f5e299", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "ea8c5f15-a843-4a5f-9164-b7ee427e2a15", "text": "nal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.107; 2026 PCP iVA p.33 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.31; 2026 Card iVA p.107; 2026 PCP iVA p.33\n#: 115 | Final Corrected Claim: In the EMPA-KIDNEY trial, a randomised, parallel-group, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 6609 patients with CKD, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=3304) were evaluated vs placebo (n=3305). | Status: Corrected | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg | Study/programme: EMPA-KIDNEY | Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 PCP iVA p.41 | Ex"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:6d7580ec-1a7a-4c7c-a294-f96acea0d693", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 76, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "295da25b3a2bab7dc77869f0d027f1246986fed619f6c7f7b1206f50baa6b3d3", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "6d7580ec-1a7a-4c7c-a294-f96acea0d693", "text": "; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 PCP iVA p.41 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Card iVA p.25; 2026 Card iVA p.67; 2026 Card iVA p.104; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 PCP iVA p.41\n#: 116 | Final Corrected Claim: §In the EMPA-KIDNEY trial, a randomised, parallel-group, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 6609 patients with CKD, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=3304) were evaluated vs placebo (n=3305). | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg | Study/programme: EMPA-KIDNEY | Specialty context: Cardio-Renal, Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iV"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5c4499f9-baf6-4338-803e-3efdf3dc22d2", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 77, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "a9d85f2c8c68b86756c0c7bcef63eeaff4ffc0eb9c2f658f018624502e6134a2", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "5c4499f9-baf6-4338-803e-3efdf3dc22d2", "text": "asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.21; 2026 Endo iVA p.24; 2026 PCP iVA p.29\n#: 117 | Final Corrected Claim: ¶¶Sustained insulin dose increase was defined as time to first increase in total daily insulin dose by >20% from baseline total daily insulin dose, sustained for at least 2 consecutive visits at a minimum of 13 weeks apart, analysed in patients treated with insulin at baseline.8 ##Incident or worsening nephropathy is defined as progression to macroalbuminuria, doubling of serum creatinine, eGFR of ≤45 mL/min/1.73 m2; initiation of renal replacement therapy; death from renal disease. | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 20% | Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.32 | Extracted only from"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:dc07ff45-b52f-4e63-815b-f76df2c3df47", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 78, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "07a9058d8f034b11ee0bfbe0955755792136e328e5589837c387343552168738", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "dc07ff45-b52f-4e63-815b-f76df2c3df47", "text": "tion: Quantitative detail: 20% | Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.32 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.32\n#: 118 | Final Corrected Claim: There were no significant differences between the placebo and JARDIANCE groups of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09; p=0.22) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67; p=0.16).5 ||Pooled data from 10-mg and 25-mg doses of JARDIANCE; both doses showed a comparable reduction in the risk of CV death.5 ¶Standard of care included CV medications and glucose-lowering agents given at the discretion of healthcare providers and according to recommendations of local guidelines.5 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 95%; HR=0.87; HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0; p=0.22; p=0.16 | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:1a2e05b9-7a35-49c9-88b9-8dc05a2e79e8", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 79, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "52b7bbc377a19c236cd4ed74bf2e1d31853bd3c3f020cbd0d6f3b0a3175a26dc", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "1a2e05b9-7a35-49c9-88b9-8dc05a2e79e8", "text": "detail: 95%; HR=0.87; HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0; p=0.22; p=0.16 | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.107 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 5 | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.107\n#: 119 | Final Corrected Claim: #In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg; 25 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 120 | Final Corrected Claim: *Key inclusion"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:81b45dc9-0d9d-466c-812f-f281b5c1f7ca", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 80, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "8cebc92c57b87f660160eab7d180ae7379983b6c6d415748cf0026844930c0ac", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "81b45dc9-0d9d-466c-812f-f281b5c1f7ca", "text": "notes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 120 | Final Corrected Claim: *Key inclusion criteria included a chronic HF (NYHA class II-IV) diagnosis, an elevated NT-proBNP level, and therapy with the appropriate doses of HF medication. Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of ≥1000 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of 31% to 35% or a level of ≥2500 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of 36% to 40%, as compared with a level of ≥600 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of ≤30%. | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology, Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157; 2026 PCP iVA p.105 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157; 2026 PCP iVA p.105\n#: 121 | Final Corrected"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b549bc36-5e99-4487-8ef3-9e8d4b3630f4", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 81, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "82c32fedd501ac8ad23e49a7b32a9e91067f25dd275220025d9d6d67cda34633", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "b549bc36-5e99-4487-8ef3-9e8d4b3630f4", "text": "label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.85; 2026 Card iVA p.157; 2026 PCP iVA p.105\n#: 121 | Final Corrected Claim: In a subgroup analysis at 24 weeks of patients with baseline BMI ≥35, adjusted mean changes in weight were -0.34 kg for placebo (n=29), -2.63 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -3.35 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -2.28 for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -3.01 for JARDIANCE 25 mg. | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 25 mg; 10 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 3 | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 122 | Final Corrected Claim: A convenient, easy-to-use option with once-daily, oral dosing1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: H"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:123d942e-1400-49c0-99a0-74de20f1ef3c", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 82, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "298f1688b84a9fea1cda6c3c6a4cf81a5a16693d90cdac1cf50016140eec7c52", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "123d942e-1400-49c0-99a0-74de20f1ef3c", "text": "option with once-daily, oral dosing1 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.47; 2026 Card iVA p.90; 2026 Card iVA p.119 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 1 | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.47; 2026 Card iVA p.90; 2026 Card iVA p.119\n#: 123 | Final Corrected Claim: Initiate with JARDIANCE 10 mg. Continue with 10 mg in patients already taking JARDIANCE. | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.47; 2026 PCP iVA p.44 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.47; 2026 PCP"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:3a14091a-1804-43f1-b06f-f629927b63db", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 83, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "1a698187b854de960bedaf3229fe38695b9d57f07f6c16df054854b72cbdfdb0", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "3a14091a-1804-43f1-b06f-f629927b63db", "text": "lidation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.47; 2026 PCP iVA p.44\n#: 124 | Final Corrected Claim: In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -3.96 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -4.99 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg. Missing data were imputed using the LOCF approach.3 | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg; 25 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 125 | Final Corrected Claim: Initiate with JARDIANCE 10 mg."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:48831919-bb94-4f03-a9ed-92e3d2f5f4e3", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 84, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "dae27ab8c97bf632d2d93c880f707cd45fa872c48a83a9e00712dab19db4e445", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "48831919-bb94-4f03-a9ed-92e3d2f5f4e3", "text": "label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57; 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 125 | Final Corrected Claim: Initiate with JARDIANCE 10 mg. \nIn patients tolerating 10 mg and requiring additional glycaemic control, the dose can be increased to 25 mg. | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg; 25 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.47 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.47\n#: 126 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=48). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -0.73% for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -1.0% for JARDIANCE 25 mg. Missing data were imputed using the LOCF | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 0.73%; 1.0%; 25 mg; 10 mg | Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 P"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:706c9077-d453-4ebd-9cbc-90ba73ae0cf1", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 85, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "11ac96878578f9f315bf450d3a93936cf272915ef583ccaf3f7f2c85464be9ad", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "706c9077-d453-4ebd-9cbc-90ba73ae0cf1", "text": "nce: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 0.73%; 1.0%; 25 mg; 10 mg | Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.36 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.36\n#: 127 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE reduced the need for large increases in insulin dose¶¶8 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.29 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 8 | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.29\n#: 128 | Final Corrected Claim: for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=213), respectively. Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -0.6% for both JARDIANCE 10 mg and 25 mg; p<0.001 vs placebo for both doses.2 | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b181d843-781c-4595-ada0-541b828de8f9", "@ty