"section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "de299bbec4f15076dac2ab14583c0b57545cce9a7ac1bc9267b3057925e73d1b", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "46eaee92-76b3-40c4-948f-4e6644146df6", "text": "adjusted mean changes in HbA1c were -0.5% for placebo (n=50), -1.2% for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=57), and -1.5% for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=48). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -0.73% for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -1.0% for JARDIANCE 25 mg. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Type 2 diabetes | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 8.5%; 0.5%; 1.2%; 1.5%; 10 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.57 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.57\n#: 142 | Final Corrected Claim: Continue with 10 mg in patients with T2D + eCVD already taking JARDIANCE. | Status: Confirmed complete | Indication: Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Quantitative detail: 10 mg | Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.47 | Extracted o"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:d29445bd-2308-4ac3-8993-343abef68b67", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 97, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "3e82d5d56b0c6ccf90e676ffd5dbfd6582664ff7a3c