tion for heart failure. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Type 2 diabetes; Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.93 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.93\n#: 145 | Final Corrected Claim: Pooled data from 10-mg and 25-mg doses of JARDIANCE; both doses showed a comparable reduction in the risk of CV death. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Type 2 diabetes; Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Key Message Type: Dosing / Administration | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.96 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Fo"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:047a9df3-4611-4905-ae9d-c98d3024a922", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 99, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "aa149563b4c39721e44b984e961878a675e3b793562f6986e04b4a4b9cf646e3", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "047a9df3-4611-4905-ae9d-c98d3024a922", "text": "26 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.96 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.96\n#: 146 | Final Corrected Claim: 2024 KDIGO guidelines on CKD management recommend SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, for first-line treatment. | Status: Corrected | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Endocrinology, Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.42; 2026 PCP iVA p.24 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.42; 2026 PCP iVA p.24\n#: 147 | Final Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE, an SGLT2i, is recommended to reduce cardio-renal risk in high-risk patients with: \n• T2D + ASCVD\n• T2D + indicators of high risk\n• T2D + HF\n• T2D + CKD | Status: Corrected | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Mech"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:58526604-74e8-4f75-910e-e7243fc1c5ae", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 100, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "5d48271cc66e3c32b14d88ada838ab50afb5b424c6682e0c70ae712af03d2d90", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "58526604-74e8-4f75-910e-e7243fc1c5ae", "text": "• T2D + ASCVD\n• T2D + indicators of high risk\n• T2D + HF\n• T2D + CKD | Status: Corrected | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.41 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Ref