 Corrected Claim: JARDIANCE is the first and only SGLT2i to show positive outcomes when initiated in the hospital within 1-5 days after stabilisation | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.33; 2026 Card iVA p.75; 2026 Card iVA p.138 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory val"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:4260a93b-527d-437c-ba54-bb66d3a0f1d4", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 102, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "293a22e596d9633ecd18d606d08e2c3daf6f194382312bf1ab3aac6c0f6bb7ad", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "4260a93b-527d-437c-ba54-bb66d3a0f1d4", "text": "(s): 2026 Card iVA p.33; 2026 Card iVA p.75; 2026 Card iVA p.138 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.33; 2026 Card iVA p.75; 2026 Card iVA p.138\n#: 151 | Final Corrected Claim: International T2D guidelines recommend the use of an SGLT2i such as JARDIANCE as early as first line2-5 | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.40 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: 2-5 | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.40\n#: 152 | Final Corrected Claim: SGLT2is are a Cla