SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, are Class I recommended \nfor first-line use in patients"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:4b5b5b25-7788-4b4d-ac45-45e94b6cf190", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 104, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "section_id": "bea594c4-2c6e-483c-b23c-9c09bfaef9da", "extraction_method": "openpyxl", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_hash": "a4d1abdd0f81fa755b2e23086c42b4c63c15d1a36f9d8c5f22a056deae396c64", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "chunk_id": "4b5b5b25-7788-4b4d-ac45-45e94b6cf190", "text": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.25\n#: 154 | Final Corrected Claim: SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, are Class I recommended \nfor first-line use in patients with CVD + T2D to reduce \nthe risk of CV events*3 | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required. | Footnotes: See source asset footnotes and local label. | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.17; 2026 Card iVA p.62\n#: 155 | Final Corrected Claim: SGLT2is, such as JARDIANCE, are Class I recommended for first-line use in patients with CVD + T2D to reduce the risk of CV events, independent of glucose control1 | Status: Corrected | Indication: General | Key Message Type: Mechanism of action | End Audience: HCP/Internal | Contextual Information: Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.99 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation i"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:2710d622-d588-439d-a9df-8592319be3f7", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_inde