         |                  |\n| 45 to <60                  | 112/ 792                   | 143/ 773                   | 0.73 (0.57,0.93)       |                              |"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:91a0e70c-28e5-436e-b691-5dd236c12d31", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 183, "token_count": 297, "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "4dc7a36e-6ebe-440c-ac60-e3b566432bd5", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "c1c2893d656c3c25a384763a5fee5ac544782a2356b63a8b37f9cbbf67eeb4e7", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "91a0e70c-28e5-436e-b691-5dd236c12d31", "text": "| 45 to <60                  | 112/ 792                   | 143/ 773                   | 0.73 (0.57,0.93)       |                              |                  |\n| 30 to <45                  | 106/ 564                   | 123/ 550                   | 0.82 (0.64, 1.07)      |                              |                  |\n| <30                        | 45/ 148                    | 55/ 161                    | 0.81 (0.55, 1.21)      |                              |                  |\n| NYHA at baseline           |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |\n| II                         | 275/2435                   | 361/2452                   | 0.75 (0.64,0.87)       | 1--+---l                     |                  |\n| Ill/IV                     | 140/ 562                   | 150/ 539                   | 0.86 (0.68, 1.09)      |                              |                  |\n| LVEF at baseline           |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |\n| >40% to <50%               | 145/ 995"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5418b230-75ed-4eee-8a21-bfc2a5d14150", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 184, "token_count": 294, "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "4dc7a36e-6ebe-440c-ac60-e3b566432bd5", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "42a964ad61c8116655f996deba993dab382fba0961231a4f69f6e41095c48298", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "5418b230-75ed-4eee-8a21-bfc2a5d14150", "text": "|                        |                              |                  |\n| >40% to <50%               | 145/ 995                   | 193/ 988                   | 0.71 (0.57,0.88)       | I ■ I                        |                  |\n| 50% to <60%                | 138/1028                   | 173/1030                   | 0.80 (0.64,0.99)       |                              |                  |\n| 2:60%                      | 132/ 974                   | 145/ 973                   | 0.87 (0.69, 1.10)      |                              |                  |\n| NT-proBNP                  |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |\n| < median                   | 126/1477                   | 168/1508                   | 0.76 (0.61 ,0.96)      | I ■ I                        |                  |\n| 2: median                  | 288/1516                   | 341/1476                   | 0.78 (0.67,0.91)       | i----1                       |                  |\n| Baseline use of MRA        |                            |                            |                        |"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:6c2eefa1-c807-4743-8c24-33c3bc8ee200", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 185, "token_count": 172, "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "4dc7a36e-6ebe-440c-ac60-e3b566432bd5", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "81de70f1205c455593ae032b39f1a4f1e54ef357ff3b4ccc6ccf27c0f50131c3", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "6c2eefa1-c807-4743-8c24-33c3bc8ee200", "text": "|                  |\n| Baseline use of MRA        |                            |                            |                        |                              |                  |\n| No                         | 233/1878                   | 306/1866                   | 0.73 (0.62,0.87)       | f----+---l                   |                  |\n| Yes                        | 182/1119                   | 205/1125                   | 0.87 (0. 71 , 1.06)    | I----+- --l                  |                  |\n|                            |                            |                            |                        | I I 0.25 0.5                 | I 2              |\n\nHazard ratio"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:5c05d428-069c-4a22-b56b-d79a7b693d85", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 186, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 41, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "d264d769-bb13-4f96-a14e-76ee1de70c51", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "1310c626e70bc0ad77de78ab4228a0b04d2cb9ff83f7ca0d81923fa19111618d", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "5c05d428-069c-4a22-b56b-d79a7b693d85", "text": "EMPA-KIDNEY (NCT03594110) was a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial conducted in adults with chronic kidney disease (eGFR ≥ 20 to &lt;45 mL/min/1.73 m 2 ; or eGFR ≥ 45 to &lt;90 mL/min/1.73 m 2 with urine albumin to creatinine ratio [UACR] ≥ 200 mg/g). The trial excluded patients with polycystic kidney disease or patients requiring intravenous immunosuppressive therapy in the preceding three months or &gt;45 mg of prednisone (or equivalent) at the time of screening. The primary objective of the trial was to assess the effects of empagliflozin as an adjunct to standard of care therapy, including RAS-inhibitor therapy when appropriate, on time to kidney disease progression or cardiovascular death.\n\nA total of 6,609 patients, were equally randomized to JARDIANCE 10 mg or placebo and were followed for a median of 24 months.\n\nThe mean age of the study population was 63 years (range: 18 to 94 years) and 67% were male. Approximately 58% of the study population were White, 36% Asian, and 4% Black or African American. Approximately 44% of the patients had type 2 diabetes mellitus.\n\nAt baseline, the mean eGFR was 37 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , 21% of patients had an eGFR equal to or abo"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:b6d44474-12db-46c0-a36c-5b4ebeacb6f2", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 187, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 41, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "d264d769-bb13-4f96-a14e-76ee1de70c51", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "ba57eae9597ffd162b39da1585d415eb974974492f9e18f9c4159364af7eca4e", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "b6d44474-12db-46c0-a36c-5b4ebeacb6f2", "text": "ely 44% of the patients had type 2 diabetes mellitus.\n\nAt baseline, the mean eGFR was 37 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , 21% of patients had an eGFR equal to or above 45 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , 44% had an eGFR 30 to less than 45 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , and 35% had an eGFR less than 30 mL/min/1.73 m 2 . The median UACR was 329 mg/g, 20% of patients had a UACR &lt;30 mg/g, 28% had a UACR 30 to ≤ 300mg/g, and 52% had a UACR &gt;300 mg/g. Approximately 1% of patients had type 1 diabetes at baseline. The most common etiologies of CKD were diabetic nephropathy/diabetic kidney disease (31%), glomerular disease (25%), hypertensive/renovascular disease (22%) and other/unknown (22%).\n\nAt baseline, 85% of patients were treated with ACE inhibitor or ARB, 64% with statins, and 34% with antiplatelet agents.\n\nJARDIANCE was superior to placebo in reducing the risk of the primary composite endpoint of sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , progression to end-stage kidney disease, or CV or renal death. The treatment effect reflected a reduction in a sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , progression to end-stage kidney disease, and CV death. There were few renal d"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:89249716-31d5-4658-a445-ece2378f0957", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 188, "token_count": 96, "page_number": 41, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "d264d769-bb13-4f96-a14e-76ee1de70c51", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "9e3369b4cb20be09c42a5deee6852974478345f006c45d65080755b56a313c2b", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "89249716-31d5-4658-a445-ece2378f0957", "text": "a sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , progression to end-stage kidney disease, and CV death. There were few renal deaths during the trial. JARDIANCE also reduced the risk of first and recurrent hospitalization (see Table 18 and Figure 13); information collected on the reason for hospitalization was insufficient to further characterize the benefit."}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:6a70e28e-0ddd-4eef-86c6-0e1f13b87823", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 189, "token_count": 277, "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "3c08935e-ad6c-42ca-8aa1-31c7cd8730c3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "07c9092d422f429cff906d0b9023613bf1f0ef1305c039fa2a1ad0abae7d5637", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "6a70e28e-0ddd-4eef-86c6-0e1f13b87823", "text": "Table 18 Treatment Effect for the Primary Composite Endpoint, its Components and Key Secondary Endpoints\n\n|                                                                                                                                          | Placebo N=3,305        | JARDIANCE 10 mg N=3,304   | Hazard ratio vs placebo (95% CI)   | p-value   |\n|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------|---------------------------|------------------------------------|-----------|\n|                                                                                                                                          | Number of Patients (%) | Number of Patients (%)    |                                    |           |\n| Composite of sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline, sustained eGFR <10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , ESKD a , or CV or renal death (time to first occurrence) | 558 (16.9)             | 432 (13.1)                | 0.72 (0.64, 0.82)                  | <0.0001   |\n| Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:718cacd9-ea0d-451e-a57a-1330b81374c9", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 190, "token_count": 295, "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "3c08935e-ad6c-42ca-8aa1-31c7cd8730c3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "7ebfa22509e411461f3c7dbb48c30ea226b2bb2033f79b697080d057ed5a378b", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "718cacd9-ea0d-451e-a57a-1330b81374c9", "text": "| <0.0001   |\n| Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR decline                                                                                                             | 474 (14.3)             | 359 (10.9)                | 0.70 (0.61, 0.81)                  |           |\n| ESKD a or sustained eGFR <10 mL/min/1.73 m 2                                                                                             | 221 (6.7)              | 157 (4.8)                 | 0.69 (0.56, 0.84)                  |           |\n| Renal death b                                                                                                                            | 4 (0.1)                | 4 (0.1)                   |                                    |           |\n| CV death                                                                                                                                 | 69 (2.1)               | 59 (1.8)                  | 0.84 (0.60, 1.19)                  |           |\n|                                                                                                                                          | Number of Events       | Number of Events          |"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:3c653e75-4f8d-4ed5-a2b8-aeebc65998ad", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 191, "token_count": 134, "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "3c08935e-ad6c-42ca-8aa1-31c7cd8730c3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "188b8fd2d8c8c546c5b13faf1a64edd0a5e437b8e59000c25713d80ccd94ec3c", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "3c653e75-4f8d-4ed5-a2b8-aeebc65998ad", "text": "| Number of Events       | Number of Events          |                                    |           |\n| First and recurrent hospitalization c                                                                                                    | 1,895                  | 1,611                     | 0.86 (0.78, 0.95)                  | 0.0025    |\n\nFigure 13 Time to First Occurrence of the Primary Composite Endpoint, Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR Decline, Sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , ESKD or Renal Death, or CV Death\n\n<!-- image -->"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:f7d24202-33b1-4823-8bcf-d457b2e87bd1", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 192, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 43, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "e9926b95-b9be-4616-8439-b94fe1fbed2c", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "Jardiance_PI.pdf", "source_hash": "f50f307032993369edbc897488856e6512e153611eded703576e4eb2a5fb7e94", "source_document_id": "b2560bb2-851a-4e06-8246-07641712e8b0", "chunk_id": "f7d24202-33b1-4823-8bcf-d457b2e87bd1", "text": "The results of the primary composite endpoint were generally consistent across the pre-specified subgroups examined, including eGFR categories, underlying cause of kidney disease, diabetes status, or background use of RAS inhibitors (see Figure 14).  The treatment benefit with JARDIANCE on the primary composite endpoint was not evident in patients with very low levels of albuminuria, however there were few events in these patients.\n\nFigure 14 Treatment Effects for the Primary Composite Endpoint (Sustained ≥ 40% eGFR Decline, Sustained eGFR &lt;10 mL/min/1.73 m 2 , ESKD or Renal Death, or CV Death) Subgroup Analysis (EMPA-KIDNEY)\n\n| Subgroup                          | N with event/ N        | analyzed   | Hazard ratio       | Interaction   | Empagliflozin 1 O mg better ~   | Placebo better   |\n|-----------------------------------|------------------------|------------|--------------------|---------------|---------------------------------|------------------|\n| Category                          | Empagliflozin 10 mg vs | Placebo    | (95%CI)            | p-value       |                                 |                  |\n| Overall                           | 432/3304               | 5"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:40583a0d-6356-49c7-a41d-311347191149", "@type": "Chunk", "graphScope": "brand", "chunk_index": 193, "token_count": 300, "page_number": 43, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "e9926b95-b9be-4616-8439-b94fe1fbed2c", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "J