 "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "Based on a systematic review and network meta-analysis of randomised clinical trials investigating the effects of the recommended drug groups for HFrEF, or those that have recently been shown to improve clinical outcomes in adult patients with HFrEF.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 100, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:100"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:101", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "*EMPEROR-Preserved included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%).1", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 101, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:101"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:102", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "*EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%).1", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 102, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:102"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:103", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "*EMPEROR-Reduced included adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 103, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:103"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:104", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "Despite being a guideline-recommended treatment across LVEF, \nSGLT2is remain underutilised to treat HF.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 104, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:104"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:105", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "In the EMPEROR-Reduced trial, a randomised, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled study of 3730 patients with HFrEF, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=1863) were evaluated vs placebo (n=1867). Patients were adults with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%). The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced trial was a composite of CV death or hospitalisation for HF, analysed as time to the first event. Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 25% RRR in this endpoint \n(HR=0.75; 95% CI: 0.65, 0.86; p<0.001).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 105, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:105"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:106", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "In the EMPEROR-Preserved trial, a randomised, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled study of 5988 patients with HFpEF, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=2997) were evaluated vs placebo (n=2991). Patients were adults with chronic heart failure (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%). The primary endpoint in the EMPEROR-Preserved trial was a composite of CV death or HHF, analysed as time to the first event. Patients treated with JARDIANCE experienced a 21% RRR in this endpoint \n(HR=0.79; 95% CI: 0.69, 0.90; p<0.001).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 106, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:106"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:107", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "Patients were adults with chronic heart failure (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and reduced ejection fraction (LVEF ≤40%).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 107, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:107"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:108", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "In addition to the RRR of all HHF, including first and recurrent events, the risk of total hospitalisations for any reason was also significantly reduced (HR=0.85; 95% CI: 0.75, 0.95).1 \n\nII Standard of care: All patients received appropriate treatments for heart failure, including diuretics, inhibitors of the renin-angiotensin system and neprilysin, beta blockers, mineralocorticoid receptor antagonists and, when indicated, cardiac devices.1", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 108, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:108"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:109", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "†Adult patients with chronic HF (NYHA class II, III, or IV) and preserved ejection fraction (LVEF >40%).2", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 109, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:109"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:110", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "Key inclusion criteria included a chronic HF (NYHA class II-IV) diagnosis, an elevated NT-proBNP level, and structural heart changes or documented hospitalisation for HF within 12 months. Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of >300 pg/mL or, for patients with atrial fibrillation at baseline, a level of >900 pg/mL.2", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 110, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:110"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:111", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "‡Standard of care: All patients received appropriate treatments for heart failure, including diuretics, inhibitors of the renin-angiotensin system and neprilysin, beta blockers,", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 111, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:111"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:112", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candi