approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "JARDIANCE is 1A recommended for first-line treatment of CKD, with or without T2D9", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 114, "indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Chronic kidney disease", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:114"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:115", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Guideline / Standard of care", "claim_text": "In addition to reducing the risk of CV death when added to the standard of care, JARDIANCE lowered HbA1c,  weight and blood pressure. JARDIANCE is not indicated for weight loss or reduction of blood pressure.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 115, "indication": "Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:115"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:116", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "In the EMPA-KIDNEY trial, a randomised, parallel-group, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 6609 patients with CKD, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=3304) were evaluated vs placebo (n=3305).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 116, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:116"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:117", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "§In the EMPA-KIDNEY trial, a randomised, parallel-group, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 6609 patients with CKD, the efficacy and safety of JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=3304) were evaluated vs placebo (n=3305).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 117, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:117"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:118", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "¶¶Sustained insulin dose increase was defined as time to first increase in total daily insulin dose by >20% from baseline total daily insulin dose, sustained for at least 2 consecutive visits at a minimum of 13 weeks apart, analysed in patients treated with insulin at baseline.8 ##Incident or worsening nephropathy is defined as progression to macroalbuminuria, doubling of serum creatinine, eGFR of ≤45 mL/min/1.73 m2; initiation of renal replacement therapy; death from renal disease.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 118, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:118"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:119", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "There were no significant differences between the placebo and JARDIANCE groups of nonfatal MI (HR=0.87; 95% CI: 0.70, 1.09; p=0.22) or nonfatal stroke (HR=1.24; 95% CI: 0.92, 1.67; p=0.16).5 ||Pooled data from 10-mg and 25-mg doses of JARDIANCE; both doses showed a comparable reduction in the risk of CV death.5 ¶Standard of care included CV medications and glucose-lowering agents given at the discretion of healthcare providers and according to recommendations of local guidelines.5", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 119, "indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:119"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:120", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "#In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41).", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 120, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:120"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:121", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "*Key inclusion criteria included a chronic HF (NYHA class II-IV) diagnosis, an elevated NT-proBNP level, and therapy with the appropriate doses of HF medication. Elevated NT-proBNP is defined as a level of ≥1000 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of 31% to 35% or a level of ≥2500 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of 36% to 40%, as compared with a level of ≥600 pg/mL in those with an ejection fraction of ≤30%.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 121, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:121"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:122", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "In a subgroup analysis at 24 weeks of patients with baseline BMI ≥35, adjusted mean changes in weight were -0.34 kg for placebo (n=29), -2.63 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -3.35 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -2.28 for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -3.01 for JARDIANCE 25 mg.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 122, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:122"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:123", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "A convenient, easy-to-use option with once-daily, oral dosing1", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 123, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:123"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:124", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "Initiate with JARDIANCE 10 mg. Continue with 10 mg in patients already taking JARDIANCE.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 124, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:124"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:125", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Dosing / Administration", "claim_text": "In a double-blind extension trial, adjusted mean changes in weight for patients with baseline BMI ≥35 at Week 76 were 0.23 kg for placebo (n=29), -3.74 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg (n=33), and -4.77 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg (n=41). Difference from placebo (adjusted mean) was -3.96 kg for JARDIANCE 10 mg and -4.99 kg for JARDIANCE 25 mg. Missing data were imputed using the LOCF approach.3", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 125, "indication": "General", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:125"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:cla