ion", "claim_text": "Rapid sequencing rationale: Drugs should be prioritised based on efficacy, safety, and ease of use, initiating an additional GDMT class likely yields a greater benefit than titrating a class in use, and background therapy can facilitate the use of other drugs by enhancing safety.1", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 165, "indication": "Heart failure", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Corrected", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:165"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:166", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP/Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Mechanism of action", "claim_text": "ESC Guidelines: As an SGLT2i, JARDIANCE is a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy for patients with HFpEF to reduce the risk of CV death or HHF.2", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 166, "indication": "Heart failure; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:166"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-