ed patients with CKD.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 197, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:197"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:198", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP / Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "claim_text": "In the EMPOWER meta-analysis, JARDIANCE reduced the risk of acute kidney injury by 27% and the risk of a 50% or greater increase in serum creatinine by 20%.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 198, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease; Heart failure; Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:198"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:199", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP / Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "claim_text": "In the EMPOWER meta-analysis, JARDIANCE reduced the risk of kidney failure by 34% and kidney disease progression by 30%.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 199, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease; Heart failure; Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:199"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:table:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:claim:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:200", "@type": "Claim", "graphScope": "brand", "audience": "HCP / Internal", "claim_status": "candidate", "approval_status": "candidate", "key_message_type": "Safety / Tolerability", "claim_text": "The risk of selected serious adverse events with JARDIANCE remained low and comparable with placebo in more than 20,000 patients.", "table_id": "5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48", "source_document_type": "claims_content_modules", "row_number": 200, "indication": "Chronic kidney disease; Heart failure; Type 2 diabetes; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "source_file_name": "JARDIANCE_Claims_Corrected_Final-1 (1) 2.xlsx", "source_document_id": "13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0", "source_status": "Confirmed complete", "CLAIM_DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:13ae0354-6211-4820-b97a-7634167e0ed0"}], "CLAIM_SUPPORTED_BY_REFERENCE": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:reference:5812fcb9-1028-4304-99d1-d1da70d2fc48:200"}], "DERIVED_FROM_TABLE": [{"@id": "u