eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "PC SN\n\nNN", "DERIVED_FROM_SECTION": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:section:acc6f28f-1d59-421c-92f8-e768575923fd"}], "DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:896838db-bc61-4771-8c23-6d9be8641d3d", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Urinary tract infection, seen commonly (may affect up to 1 in 10 people)", "page_number": 53, "source_document_type": "product_information", "section_id": "896838db-bc61-4771-8c23-6d9be8641d3d", "source_file_name": "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf", "source_document_id": "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "The signs of urinary tract infection are:\n\n- burning sensation when passing urine\n- urine that appears cloudy\n- pain in the pelvis, or mid-back pain (when kidneys are infected)\n\nAn urge to pass urine or more frequent urination may be due to the way Jardiance works, but they can also be signs of urinary tract infection. If you note an increase in such symptoms, you should also contact your doctor.", "DERIVED_FROM_SECTION": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:section:896838db-bc61-4771-8c23-6d9be8641d3d"}], "DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:fafeb608-3e0c-4e1f-9850-ebd9bad6f2b5", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "", "page_number": 47, "source_document_type": "product_information", "section_id": "fafeb608-3e0c-4e1f-9850-ebd9bad6f2b5", "source_file_name": "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf", "source_document_id": "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "| MINIMUM PARTICULARS TO APPEAR ON BLISTERS OR STRIPS   |\n|-------------------------------------------------------|\n| Blisters (perforated)                                 |\n\n| 1.   | NAME OF THE MEDICINAL PRODUCT   |\n|------|---------------------------------|\n\nJardiance 25 mg tablets empagliflozin\n\n| 2.   | NAME OF THE MARKETING AUTHORISATION HOLDER   |\n|------|----------------------------------------------|\n\nBoehringer Ingelheim\n\n| 3.   | EXPIRY DATE   |\n|------|---------------|\n\nEXP\n\n| 4.   | BATCH NUMBER   |\n|------|----------------|\n\nLot\n\n| 5.   | OTHER   |\n|------|---------|\n\n47", "DERIVED_FROM_SECTION": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:section:fafeb608-3e0c-4e1f-9850-ebd9bad6f2b5"}], "DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:de2b0f85-0b5c-4b61-984e-7f26e2c2a27e", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "B. PACKAGE LEAFLET", "page_number": 48, "source_document_type": "product_information", "section_id": "de2b0f85-0b5c-4b61-984e-7f26e2c2a27e", "source_file_name": "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf", "source_document_id": "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "", "DERIVED_FROM_SECTION": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:section:de2b0f85-0b5c-4b61-984e-7f26e2c2a27e"}], "DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:3ea75281-99cd-4b86-95e9-c60fa4ddff81", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Package leaflet: Information for the patient", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "product_information", "section_id": "3ea75281-99cd-4b86-95e9-c60fa4ddff81", "source_file_name": "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf", "source_document_id": "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "", "DERIVED_FROM_SECTION": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:section:3ea75281-99cd-4b86-95e9-c60fa4ddff81"}], "DERIVED_FROM_DOCUMENT": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:document:98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:15d9e924-6587-4919-ab48-cbb09b9bbea8", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Jardiance 10 mg film-coated table