eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:pisection:066c1912-9215-4686-89aa-8e6364478f6a", "@type": "PISection", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "", "page_number": 16, "source_document_type": "product_information", "section_id": "066c1912-9215-4686-89aa-8e6364478f6a", "source_file_name": "jardiance-epar-product-information_en.pdf", "source_document_id": "98de1eab-c096-475d-9a30-ff5319cefc40", "text": "| Add-on to pioglitazone +/- metformin therapy                 | Add-on to pioglitazone +/- metformin therapy   | Add-on to pioglitazone +/- metformin therapy   | Add-on to pioglitazone +/- metformin therapy   |\n|--------------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                              | Placebo                                        | Jardiance                                      | Jardiance                                      |\n|                                                              |                                                | 10 mg                                          | 25 mg                                          |\n| N                                                            | 165                                            | 165                                            | 168                                            |\n| HbA1c (%)                                                    |                                                |                                                |                                                |\n| Baseline (mean)                                              | 8.16                                           | 8.07                                           | 8.06                                           |\n| Change from baseline 1                                       | -0.11     