laim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.182; 2026 PCP iVA p.78\n#: 3 | Original Extracted Text: landmark-empa-kidney-trial-showed-significant-benefit-jardiancer | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim | Indication: General | Reference: EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.179\n#: 4 | Original Extracted Text: Early benefit with empagliflozin in heart failure with preserved ejection fraction: insights from the EMPEROR-Preserved Trial. | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim | Indication: Heart failure | Reference: 2026 Card iVA p.71\n#: 5 | Original Extracted Text: Effect of empagliflozin on the clinical stability of patients with heart failure and a reduced ejection fraction: the EMPEROR-Reduced trial. | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim | Indication: Heart failure | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.92; 2026 Card iVA p.29; 2026 PCP iVA p.112\n#: 6 | Original Extracted Text: Effects of empagliflozin on cardiovascular and renal outcomes in heart failure with reduced ejection fraction according to age: a secondary analysis of EMPEROR-Reduced. | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): incorrect claim- Reference is incorrectly identified as claim | Indication: Heart failure; Chronic kidney disease; Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Reference: EMPEROR-Reduced | 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.40\n#: 7 | Original Extracted Text: *Adult patients with an eGFR ≥20 mL/min/1.73 m2, <45 mL/min/1.73 m2; or an eGFR ≥45 mL/min/1.73 m2, <90 mL/min/1.73 m2 with a uACR ≥200 mg/g.2 | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- footnote containing only numerical values without complete contextual meaning has been incorrectly identified as a claim. | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.78; 2026 Endo iVA p.82; 2026 Card iVA p.181; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 Card iVA p.188; 2026 PCP iVA p.41; 2026 PCP iVA p.71; 2026 PCP iVA p.80; 2026 PCP iVA p.84\n#: 8 | Original Extracted Text: Evidence of CKD at risk of progression (measured over ≥3-month | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): The claim is incorrect and as per source the sentence is \"Evidence of CKD at risk of progression (measured over ≥3-month  period prior to and at the time of screening visit)\" which do no not have contexual meaning | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.71; 2026 Card iVA p.174; 2026 PCP iVA p.73\n#: 9 | Original Extracted Text: associations of eGFR and albuminuria with mortality and kidney outcomes. | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim-footnote  without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.  | Indication: Chronic kidney disease | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.9\n#: 10 | Original Extracted Text: (defined as hospitalisation for coronary disease, | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- sentence without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.  | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Reference: 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.66; 2026 PCP iVA p.67\n#: 11 | Original Extracted Text: Reduction in risk of CV death was independent of†1,2: | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This claim is incomplete and incorrect identified claim. As per the source asset, this content is presented as the page title/header and does not constitute a standalone claim. | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Endo iVA p.68; 2026 Card iVA p.153; 2026 PCP iVA p.101\n#: 12 | Original Extracted Text: failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death, | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- sentence without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.\n\nAs per source the sentence is present in below claim\n\" SGLT2is are a Class I, Level A-recommended therapy  for patients with HFrEF to reduce the risk of heart failure hospitalisation or cardiovascular death, making JARDIANCE 1 of 4 foundational treatments  for HFrEF \" | Indication: Cardiovascular risk / established CVD | Reference: 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.43; 2026 PCP iVA p.25\n#: 13 | Original Extracted Text: (JARDIANCE, 1611 hospitalisations in 960 patients; placebo, 1895 hospitalisations in 1035 patients).1 | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): Incorrect claim- Incomplete sentence from footnote without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. \n\nAs per source the complete claim is \"Hospitalisation for any cause was a key secondary outcome of the EMPA-KIDNEY trial. The analysis of hospitalisations for any cause included the first and all subsequent events (JARDIANCE, 1611 hospitalisations in 960 patients; placebo, 1895 hospitalisations in 1035 patients).\" | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 PCP iVA p.80\n#: 14 | Original Extracted Text: *Patients with CAD, PAD, or history of MI or stroke.2 | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): incorrect claim-footnote without complete contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.  | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA p.100\n#: 15 | Original Extracted Text: Mean survival times decline with every HF hospitalisation3 | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This claim is  incorrectly identified claim. As per the source asset, this content is presented as a title for graph and does not constitute a standalone claim. | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.8; 2026 Card iVA p.53\n#: 16 | Original Extracted Text: Mean survival times for the first, second, third, and fourth hospitalisations were all significant (p<0.0001) and as follows: 2.6 (95% CI: 2.62, 2.65), 1.8 (95% CI: 1.76, 1.81), 1.5 (95% CI: 1.42, 1.50), and 1.3 (95% CI: 1.25, 1.37) years, respectively. | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim.  | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.8; 2026 Card iVA p.53\n#: 17 | Original Extracted Text: death from CV causes, hospitalisation for any cause (including the first and any subsequent hospitalisations), and death from any cause | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.71; 2026 Card iVA p.174; 2026 PCP iVA p.73\n#: 18 | Original Extracted Text: endpoint plus hospitalisation for unstable angina | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This is incorrectly identifies as claim and the sentence without contextual meaning is incorrectly identified as claim. | Indication: General | Reference: 2026 Card iVA; 2026 Endo iVA; 2026 PCP iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.59; 2026 Card iVA p.143; 2026 PCP iVA p.86\n#: 19 | Original Extracted Text: †Hospitalisation for any cause was a key secondary outcome of the EMPA-KIDNEY trial. The analysis of hospitalisations for any cause included the first and all subsequent events | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): The claim is incorrect and the footnote without contexual meaning identified as claim | Indication: General | Reference: EMPA-KIDNEY | 2026 Card iVA; 2026 PCP iVA; 2026 Card iVA p.184; 2026 PCP iVA p.80\n#: 20 | Original Extracted Text: been shown to improve clinical outcomes in adult patients with HFrEF.1 | Reason for Exclusion (Observation): This is incorrectly identified as claim and the sentence is from the footnote without contexual meaning. | Indication: Heart fa