 | -1.99*                                          |\n| (97.5% CI)                                                   |                                                 | (-2.25, -1.28)                                  | (-2.48, -1.50)                                  |\n| N                                                            | 225                                             | 225                                             | 216                                             |\n| SBP (mmHg) 2                                                 |                                                 |                                                 |                                                 |\n| Baseline (mean)                                              | 128.8                                           | 128.7                                           | 129.3                                           |\n| Change from baseline 1                                       | -1.4                                            | -4.1                                            | -3.5                                            |\n| Difference from placebo 1                                    |                                                 | -2.7                                            | -2.1                                            |\n| (95% CI)                                                     |                                                 | (-4.6, -0.8)                                    | (-4.0, -0.2)                                    |", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:124378be-071d-4911-be19-a58e2dbdc9c8"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:fc34c543-9ca5-472f-8c40-72c0de4973cd"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:9f056a35-cf55-4a7a-bc8c-d3a3e51b574c"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:f32b5149-a2a3-4a72-a920-6b372e9e616f"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:38b59942-256f-417f-b588-a0d4c90d09a9"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:jardiance:chunk:084eed8d-322a-4179-