 "End Audience", "Contextual Information", "Footnotes", "Reference", "Note"], "rows": [{"row_number": 2, "cells": {"#": "1", "Final Corrected Claim": "*Primary outcome was reduction in CV events defined as composite endpoint of CV death, nonfatal MI, or nonfatal stroke. JARDIANCE reduced the relative risk of such CV events by 14%", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Quantitative detail: 14% | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.144 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "See source asset footnotes and local label.", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA p.144", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 3, "cells": {"#": "2", "Final Corrected Claim": "*Positively reinforcing continued use of JARDIANCE may significantly reduce the risk of CV death.1", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.117 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "1", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.117", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 4, "cells": {"#": "3", "Final Corrected Claim": "Initiate JARDIANCE first line to reduce your patients’ risk of CV death", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Primary Care | Source asset(s): 2026 PCP iVA | Page(s): 2026 PCP iVA p.50 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "See source asset footnotes and local label.", "Reference": "2026 PCP iVA | 2026 PCP iVA p.50", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 5, "cells": {"#": "4", "Final Corrected Claim": "†JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing the risk of CV death.1", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "Cardiovascular risk / established CVD", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.116; 2026 Card iVA p.119 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "1", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.116; 2026 Card iVA p.119", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 6, "cells": {"#": "5", "Final Corrected Claim": "#JARDIANCE helps protect patients by reducing CV risk.5", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "General", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.107 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "5", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.107", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 7, "cells": {"#": "6", "Final Corrected Claim": "*Change from baseline in clinical summary score (HF symptoms and physical limitations domains) of the KCCQ at week 52 was a prespecified secondary endpoint in the EMPEROR- Reduced and EMPEROR-Preserved trials. KCCQ change from baseline to 52 weeks. EMPEROR-Reduced: JARDIANCE 5.8 ± 0.4; placebo 4.1 ± 0.4. EMPEROR-Preserved: JARDIANCE  4.51, placebo 3.18. Patient-reported outcomes measured changes in KCCQ summary scores.", "Status": "Corrected", "Indication": "General", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Study/programme: EMPEROR-Reduced | Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.136 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "See source asset footnotes and local label.", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA p.136", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 8, "cells": {"#": "7", "Final Corrected Claim": "Initiate JARDIANCE to reduce your patients’ risk of CV death and protect them right from the start", "Status": "Corrected", "Indication": "General", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Endocrinology | Source asset(s): 2026 Endo iVA | Page(s): 2026 Endo iVA p.53 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "See source asset footnotes and local label.", "Reference": "2026 Endo iVA | 2026 Endo iVA p.53", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 9, "cells": {"#": "8", "Final Corrected Claim": "Initiate JARDIANCE today to start your patients with sustained CV protection#5", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "General", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual Information": "Specialty context: Cardiology | Source asset(s): 2026 Card iVA | Page(s): 2026 Card iVA p.106 | Extracted only from the included 2026 iVAs; local medical, legal and regulatory validation is required.", "Footnotes": "5", "Reference": "2026 Card iVA | 2026 Card iVA p.106", "Note": null}}, {"row_number": 10, "cells": {"#": "9", "Final Corrected Claim": "JARDIANCE acts fast in the first line to deliver long-term cardioprotection* for a wide range of patients6,7", "Status": "Confirmed complete", "Indication": "General", "Key Message Type": "Efficacy / Clinical benefit", "End Audience": "HCP/Internal", "Contextual 